        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents  D05-K568, Traditional Egg and Dart Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Egg and Dart Latchset has beautiful detailing around the outer edge of the escutcheon plate that adds a subtile elegance to the entire piece. It is available in a wide array of finishes, but we like it best in antique nickel or venetian bronze. Choose from one of the knobs or levers (shown below) to customize the set to suit your style. The Traditional Egg and Dart Latchset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It is 2-1/2 inches wide and 8-3/8 inches tall. Made by Brass Accents, the D05-K568 Egg and Dart Collection Latchset will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents  D05-K568 Egg and Dart Collection Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob/lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. The finish for the knob or lever you choose will match the plate finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Egg and Dart Latchset, Brass Accents D05-K568",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K568, Egg and Dart Latchset - The Egg and Dart Latchset has beautiful detailing around the outer edge of the escutcheon plate that adds a subtile elegance to the entire piece. It is available in a wide array of finishes, but we like it best in antique nickel or venetian bronze. Choose from one of the knobs or levers  to customize the set to suit your style. The Traditional Egg and Dart Latchset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It is 2-1/2 inches wide and 8-3/8 inches tall. Made by Brass Accents, the D05-K568 Egg and Dart Collection Latchset will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
